1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,500
What if you put Rp 5 million into IHSG

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,800
every single month, starting in 2010?

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,000
One rule: buy on the first trading day of every month.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,800
No timing. No selling. 202 months in a row.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,300
IHSG opened 2010 at about 2,600 points.

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,800
It more than tripled by late 2025… then 2026 happened.

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,000
Blue is what you put in. Green is what it’s worth.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,600
The early years? Mostly smooth sailing.

9
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,000
2015: the rupiah slides and your gains nearly vanish.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,900
You keep buying anyway.

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,300
March 2020. COVID. Your portfolio dips into the red.

12
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,200
You hold, and by December 2021 you cross Rp 1 billion.

13
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,900
Then comes a long, slow climb.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
December 2025: Rp 1.61 billion. Up 67%.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,700
Then IHSG falls 35% in six months.

16
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:45,000
And the green line sinks back toward the blue.

17
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:48,600
At the peak you had Rp 1.61 billion. By June 2026: Rp 1.07 billion.

18
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:51,800
Over half a billion rupiah, gone on paper in six months.

19
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,600
Today, after Rp 1.01 billion invested, you have Rp 1.17 billion.

20
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:59,800
That’s +15.6% in total, or just 1.7% a year.

21
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:03,000
DCA protects how you get in. It can’t choose when you get out.

22
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,800
Tell me in the comments.
